                    <figure class="media-card component"><a href="/images/projects/pebble/camera-prototype.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Open full camera prototype photograph"><img src="/images/projects/pebble/camera-prototype.jpg" alt="Raspberry Pi camera on a blue mount with its ribbon cable connected to the Pi" width="1536" height="2048" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption><strong>Camera connection</strong><span>The vision input connected to the Pi during bench development.</span></figcaption></figure>
