                </div>
                <details class="circuit-details"><summary>View the original midterm circuit diagram</summary><figure class="media-card circuit-media"><a href="/images/projects/pebble/midterm-circuit.png" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" aria-label="Open full original midterm circuit diagram"><img src="/images/projects/pebble/midterm-circuit.png" alt="Original midterm wiring diagram connecting Raspberry Pi GPIO to LCD, motion sensor, ultrasonic sensor, buttons, LEDs, and buzzer" width="3000" height="2769" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption><strong>Midterm circuit layout</strong><span>An earlier circuit iteration from the project repository. Select the image to inspect the full diagram.</span></figcaption></figure></details>
